omarchy-nixos
=============

This repository packages Omarchy for NixOS. It contains no copy of Omarchy's source: the
upstream tree is a pinned flake input (`basecamp/omarchy`) and is consumed from the Nix store
at build time. See docs/porting-steps.md for the complete list of modifications applied to
that tree during packaging.

