Third-party software
--------------------

Packages installed by modules/omarchy/packages.nix come from nixpkgs and carry their own
licences. docs/omarchy-package-inventory.md records which upstream package each one
translates. One package (Obsidian) is unfree; a host has to opt in with
nixpkgs.config.allowUnfree.
